---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Lopsided World · WASP-17 b"
	: "歪行星 · LOPSIDED WORLD";
const description = isEn
	? "JWST breaks the circular assumption: the first spatial map of an exoplanet's atmospheric limb reveals that hot Jupiter WASP-17 b is lopsided, with a ~650 K morning-evening divide and an evening atmosphere extending ~1.8x farther into space (Nature Astronomy 2026)."
	: "打破天文学常规假设：韦布空间望远镜首次为热木星 WASP-17 b 绘制出大气边缘空间分布图——这颗行星不是完美的正圆，晨昏两边缘温差约 650 K，傍晚大气向外膨胀足足 1.8 倍（《自然·天文学》2026）。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#050711] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-amber-500/30 selection:text-amber-200">
			<!-- Ambient Space Glow -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#f59e0b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:32px_32px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-rose-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>NAT. ASTRON. · 2026-10-14 · DOI: 10.1038/s41550-026-02986-4</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🪐</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">系外行星大气空间分布图 · 热木星 WASP-17 b</span>
							<span class="lang-en">EXOPLANET ATMOSPHERIC LIMB MAP · HOT JUPITER WASP-17 b</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">康奈尔大学 × 布里斯托大学 · 2026-10-17</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Cornell University × Bristol · 2026-10-17</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/lopsided-world/" : "/en/projects/lopsided-world/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-amber-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "Switch to Chinese" : "切换为英文"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">歪行星 · LOPSIDED WORLD</span>
					<span class="lang-en">LOPSIDED WORLD · WASP-17 b</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">每一颗你见过的行星插画都是完美的正圆——但这颗不是。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Every planet you have seen drawn is a perfect circle — this one is not.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							2026 年 10 月 14 日，国际顶级学术期刊《自然·天文学》（<em>Nature Astronomy</em>，DOI: 10.1038/s41550-026-02986-4）发表了一项打破传统假设的天文发现：天文学家利用<strong>詹姆斯·韦布空间望远镜（JWST）</strong>，首次绘制出系外行星大气边缘的精细空间分布图，并证实热木星 <strong>WASP-17 b</strong> 并非传统模型中预设的对称圆球，而是一颗晨昏剧烈不对称的“歪行星”。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Published on October 14, 2026 in <em>Nature Astronomy</em> (DOI: 10.1038/s41550-026-02986-4), astrophysicists using the <strong>James Webb Space Telescope (JWST)</strong> produced the most detailed spatial map yet of an exoplanet's atmospheric limb. They discovered that the hot Jupiter <strong>WASP-17 b</strong> is not the idealized uniform circle long assumed in exoplanet models, but a distinctly lopsided world.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							WASP-17 b 位于天蝎座，距离地球约 1,300 光年。作为一颗极端靠近恒星公转的巨型气态“热木星”，它没有坚固的固态表面，并已被恒星引力潮汐锁定：一侧永远沐浴在炽热恒星光芒中（永恒昼半球），另一侧则身处永夜。强劲的超音速赤道喷流将昼侧热量席卷至<strong>傍晚边缘（东侧）</strong>，使得该侧温度高达<strong>约 1,500 K</strong>，大气急剧膨胀，向外延伸足足达到<strong>清晨边缘（西侧，约 850 K）</strong>的 <strong>1.8 倍</strong>！
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							WASP-17 b sits roughly 1,300 light-years away. A puffy gas giant orbiting scorching close to its star, it has no solid surface and is tidally locked: one hemisphere permanently faces the star (permanent dayside) while the other remains in eternal darkness. Super-rotating equatorial winds sweep heat across the <strong>evening (eastern) limb</strong>, driving temperatures to <strong>~1,500 K</strong> and causing its atmosphere to puff out <strong>~1.8 times farther</strong> into space than the cooler <strong>morning (western) limb (~850 K)</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Attributed Quotes Section (Lili Alderson only - max two quotes) -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
					<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-amber-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
							<span>💬</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">领衔作者论断 · LILI ALDERSON (CORNELL & BRISTOL)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">LEAD AUTHOR · LILI ALDERSON (CORNELL & BRISTOL)</span>
						</div>
						<blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								莉莉·奥尔德森博士指出：“<strong class="text-amber-300">Rather than assuming your atmosphere is a circle with the same radius all the way around, our technique allows you to pull out different distances from the centre to the edge of the planet.</strong>”
								<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（“以往的方法假设整个大气层是一个各处半径相同的圆，而我们的技术允许你提取出行星中心到边缘各处不同的真实距离。”）</span>
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Dr. Lili Alderson noted: "<strong class="text-amber-300">Rather than assuming your atmosphere is a circle with the same radius all the way around, our technique allows you to pull out different distances from the centre to the edge of the planet.</strong>"
							</span>
						</blockquote>
					</div>

					<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
							<span>💬</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">三维行星概念验证 · LILI ALDERSON</span>
							<span class="lang-en">3D PLANET PROOF OF CONCEPT · LILI ALDERSON</span>
						</div>
						<blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 italic font-serif leading-relaxed">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								奥尔德森进一步强调：“<strong class="text-cyan-300">This is proof of concept that planets are in fact 3D objects, and that consistently, as they go around their star, what we predict should be happening is happening.</strong>”
								<span class="block text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 not-italic mt-1">（“这项概念验证表明，行星在本质上是立体的三维天体；随着它们绕恒星公转，理论预测应当发生的物理图景正在真实上演。”）</span>
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Dr. Lili Alderson emphasized: "<strong class="text-cyan-300">This is proof of concept that planets are in fact 3D objects, and that consistently, as they go around their star, what we predict should be happening is happening.</strong>"
							</span>
						</blockquote>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Scientific Honesty Note Card -->
				<div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
					<div class="text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
						<span>🔬</span>
						<span class="lang-zh">科学严谨性特别说明：光谱反演、示意模型与非宜居警示</span>
						<span class="lang-en">SCIENTIFIC HONESTY NOTE: SPECTRAL INFERENCES, SCHEMATICS & NON-HABITABILITY</span>
					</div>
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							必须诚实指出：页面中提及的温度（约 850 K 与约 1,500 K）是天文学家依据 JWST 透射光谱通过大气模型反演推导的<strong>理论推断值</strong>，并非在行星现场用温度计直接实测的结果；温度带有模型不确定度（其中温度较低的清晨侧受统计约束相对宽松），均应作为“约数”看待。此外，本页面中呈现的所有行星边缘不对称轮廓与凌星动画均为<strong>示意性图解（schematic illustrations）</strong>，方便读者理解空间不对称与透射弦算法，绝非行星的真实尺度光学影像。最后，WASP-17 b 是一颗表面温度超千度的气态炽热巨行星，<strong>绝非宜居世界</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							The temperatures cited (~850 K and ~1,500 K) are atmospheric-model inferences retrieved from JWST transmission spectra, not in situ thermometer measurements. They carry model uncertainties, with the cooler morning side less tightly constrained, and are presented as approximate values. All limb-shape graphics and transit animations on this page are clearly labeled <strong>schematic illustrations</strong> designed for conceptual insight, not to-scale astronomical images. WASP-17 b is a scorching gas giant with no solid surface; <strong>do not interpret it as habitable</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 5. FACTS STRIP SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
					<span class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
						<span class="lang-zh">核心物理事实一览</span>
						<span class="lang-en">CORE ASTROPHYSICAL FACTS STRIP</span>
					</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">距离地球</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DISTANCE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-black text-white mt-1">~1,300 ly</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">约 1,300 光年 (天蝎座)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">1,300 light-years away</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">晨昏温差</span>
							<span class="lang-en">THERMAL DIVIDE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-300 mt-1">~650 K</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">晨界 ~850 K vs 昏界 ~1,500 K</span>
							<span class="lang-en">~850 K vs ~1,500 K divide</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-rose-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">傍晚大气膨胀</span>
							<span class="lang-en">EVENING BULGE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-black text-rose-300 mt-1">~1.8×</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">傍晚侧延伸距离是清晨的 1.8 倍</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Extends ~1.8x farther out</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">韦布联合科学仪器</span>
							<span class="lang-en">JWST INSTRUMENTS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-300 mt-1">0.6–12 µm</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">NIRISS + NIRSpec + MIRI</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DREAMS program coverage</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-purple-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">光谱离散区间</span>
							<span class="lang-en">WAVELENGTH BANDS</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-black text-purple-300 mt-1">24 组</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">Harmonica 透射弦算法</span>
							<span class="lang-en">24 intervals around limb</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">发表日期与期刊</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DATE & JOURNAL</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-xl font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">2026-10-14</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">Nature Astronomy</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Nat. Astron. 2026</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 1. CENTERPIECE: THE PLANET THAT ISN'T ROUND -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-14 pb-12 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">
							<span>01</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">核心视觉呈现</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Flagship Centerpiece</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">不是正圆的行星：360° 边缘不对称与温度轮廓</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Planet That Isn't Round: Asymmetric Limb & Temperature Sweep</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300">
						<span class="lang-zh">⚠️ 示意性图解，非真实尺度图像</span>
						<span class="lang-en">⚠️ Schematic visual, not to-scale image</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						下方是 WASP-17 b 大气边缘的截面图示。东侧（傍晚边缘，0°）受来自永恒白昼的赤道强风吹拂，高温气体极度膨胀（呈现明亮炽热的红橙色等离子体辉光）；西侧（清晨边缘，180°）经过夜侧冷却降温后，大气相对致密收缩（呈现幽冷青蓝色）。拖动下方角度滑块或直接在星盘上扫动，实时读取该边缘角度的大气模型反演温度。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						Below is a cross-sectional illustration of WASP-17 b's atmospheric limb. The eastern (evening) limb (0°) receives scorching equatorial winds from the permanent dayside, causing gas to puff outward in a fiery orange/red bulge. The western (morning) limb (180°) has cooled across the nightside, remaining compact in cool blue. Drag the angle slider or click preset buttons to sweep around the limb and inspect inferred temperatures.
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Controls Bar -->
				<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
						<label for="limb-angle-slider" class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
							<span class="lang-zh">边缘探测方位角 (Limb Angle θ):</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Limb Angle θ:</span>
						</label>
						<span id="txt-angle-deg" class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-base font-black">0° (傍晚昏界 / Evening)</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<button id="btn-angle-evening" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold rounded-lg bg-amber-950/70 border border-amber-500/60 text-amber-200 hover:bg-amber-600 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
							<span class="lang-zh">🔥 傍晚赤道 (0° · ~1,500 K)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">🔥 Evening (0° · ~1,500 K)</span>
						</button>
						<button id="btn-angle-north" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
							<span class="lang-zh">🧊 北极 (90° · ~1,100 K)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">🧊 North Pole (90° · ~1,100 K)</span>
						</button>
						<button id="btn-angle-morning" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold rounded-lg bg-cyan-950/70 border border-cyan-500/60 text-cyan-200 hover:bg-cyan-600 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
							<span class="lang-zh">❄️ 清晨赤道 (180° · ~850 K)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">❄️ Morning (180° · ~850 K)</span>
						</button>
						<button id="btn-angle-south" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
							<span class="lang-zh">🧊 南极 (270° · ~1,100 K)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">🧊 South Pole (270° · ~1,100 K)</span>
						</button>
						<button id="btn-auto-sweep" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold rounded-lg bg-purple-950/70 border border-purple-500/50 text-purple-200 hover:bg-purple-600 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95">
							<span class="lang-zh">🔄 自动旋转扫描</span>
							<span class="lang-en">🔄 Auto Sweep</span>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Angle Range Slider -->
